<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BEVAN IN CHARGE OF EUROPEAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BEVAN IN CHARGE OF EUROPEAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Cup final between Leicester and Brive in Cardiff on January 25 will be controlled by Welsh referee Derek Bevan.</p>
<p>Bevan has taken charge of a world record 32 internationals since 1985.</p>
</text>
